---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: When the end-to-end tests run
  accDescr: A push to main, the nightly run and a manual run always run the test jobs. For a pull request, the job changes asks the API for its files; when the tests use one of them, or the files are unknown, the test jobs run, otherwise they are skipped in seconds. The required check e2e passes when every test job passed or none had to run, and fails when a job failed or was cancelled.

  PR["Pull request"] --> CHANGES{{"changes: does it change<br/>what the tests use?"}}
  MAIN["Push to main,<br/>every night, on demand"] --> TESTS
  CHANGES -- "yes, or unknown" --> TESTS["Test jobs, about 20 minutes:<br/>Board Manager 1 and 2,<br/>Home Assistant 2026.8.0"]
  CHANGES -- "no" --> SKIPPED["Test jobs skipped<br/>in seconds"]
  TESTS -- "all passed" --> PASS["Required check<br/>e2e passes"]
  SKIPPED --> PASS
  TESTS -- "failed or cancelled" --> FAIL["e2e fails"]

  classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
  classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef failed fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
  class CHANGES,TESTS,SKIPPED bot
  class PASS done
  class FAIL failed
